  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I received my index controllers last week, and coming from the vive wands, I have to say, the gesture system is extremely counter intuitive. I have no idea what gesture I'm doing when I'm just resting my hands on the controllers naturally, and having to replicate the gestures irl, such as rock n' roll and such makes chaining gestures/animations extremely difficult, not to mention there is no way to toggle said gestures/animations without wading through various tabs in the new menu. Binding a button on the index controllers/giving us the ability to bind buttons to do things such as toggle gestures would be a much more intuitive and easy way of accessing gestures and animations.",
